\ Setting the admin password while sessions read the stored one (defect 42): the hash stored is whole
100 hash-iterations !
s" old" admin-pw hash-password  admin-pw /password admin-record record!
variable reads
: reader ( -- ) begin admin-password? drop 1 reads +! pause again ;
task rd  ' reader rd start
set-admin-password
new
new
rd sleep  reads @ 10 > .
create got /password allot  got /password admin-record record@ .
s" new" got password? .  s" old" got password? .
admin-password? .  s" new" admin-pw password? .
